    {
      "id": "depends-heading",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 140,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "Service Dependencies",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "depends-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 140,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "Consumer depends on: Kafka, Redis, Floci (DynamoDB), OTel Collector\n  → Start: docker-compose up -d kafka redis floci otel-collector\n  → Run:  go run ./cmd/consumer\n\nUI depends on: Redis, Floci (DynamoDB)\n  → Start: docker-compose up -d redis floci\n  → Run:  go run ./cmd/ui\n\nCLI Producer depends on: Kafka\n  → Kafka must be reachable at kafka:9092\n  → Run:  go run ./cmd/producer",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "exposed-ports",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 120,
      "height": 400,
      "text": "Exposed Ports:\n\n9092 ← Kafka\n6379 ← Redis\n4566 ← Floci\n\n4317 ← OTel (gRPC)\n4318 ← OTel (HTTP)\n8888 ← OTel metrics\n\n8081 ← Payment UI\n8080 ← Consumer\n\nNetwork:\npayment-network\n(bridge driver)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    }
